sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Producer app
    participant Redis as Redis (Celery broker)
    participant W as Relay worker
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Brevo as Brevo API

    App->>Redis: send_task(butter_relay.process_message,<br/>project_id, template_key, to, payload, queue=relay-shared)
    Redis-->>W: task delivered
    W->>DB: load Project + active Template
    W->>DB: insert Message(status=pending)
    W->>W: validate schema and render subject/html
    W->>DB: update Message(status=processing, attempts += 1)
    W->>Brevo: send email
    alt success
        Brevo-->>W: 201 + provider_message_id
        W->>DB: update Message(status=sent)
        W->>Redis: ack (task SUCCESS)
        Note over W,Redis: Crash before ack causes redelivery (acks_late) and duplicate send.
    else failure
        Brevo-->>W: error
        W->>DB: update Message(status=failed, last_error)
        Note over W,Redis: autoretry_for=(Exception,), backoff, up to 5x;\neach retry creates another Message row;\ntask ends FAILURE after max_retries, no DLQ.
    end

    alt unhandled exception (e.g. bad kwargs, DB error)
        W-->>W: propagates out of process_message, same autoretry policy applies
        Note over W,Redis: render failure can leave a pending Message row.
    end
